# Input

```scss
.assets{
background:url( images/#{ $name   }.png  );
themed:url( #{$base}/#{$theme}/logo.svg );
font:src( fonts/#{$family}.woff2 );
}

```


# Formatted

```scss
.assets {
	background: url(images/#{ $name   }.png);
	themed: url(#{$base}/#{$theme}/logo.svg);
	font: src(fonts/#{$family}.woff2);
}

```
